# NOTE: forward_log / universe_log / cost_observations are COMMITTED DATA TAPES
# (CI appends daily). Do not ignore them.

# Registration event logs are LOCAL state (which plans have been read on this
# checkout); the sealed plans themselves in registrations/ ARE committed.
# The read ledger must stay untracked: it is per-checkout, and committing it
# would make one machine's read history part of everyone's evidence identity.
